      "content": "ugh i don't know... i'm not really in a position to go to the doctor right now. i'm broke and can't afford an eye specialist visit today. do u think it could just be eye strain or maybe just tired eyes from staring at my phone too much? it doesn't even really hurt, just looks weird.",
