      "content": "i get that but it's just so stressful thinking about the cost. i've heard of people using certain supplements or eye drops to help with eye health and floaters. like, is there anything i can just take at home to help clear them up or stop them from getting worse? i just need something i can do myself for now until i can figure things out.",
